{"3952510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Volley Guns", "steam_appid": 3952510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [4799520, 4799540], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When Volleyball Meets Firepower!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lock and load, it's time to bump, set, and unleash chaos in the most explosive twist on volleyball yet! <strong>Volley Guns</strong> is a chaotic, cartoon-styled multiplayer party game where classic volleyball rules get a full-throttle makeover…by adding <strong>guns!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952510/extras/07d910bed5fb84b323acc99214d83fd6.avif?t=1788217180\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952510/extras_big/07d910bed5fb84b323acc99214d83fd6.webp?t=1788217180 width=1560 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952510/extras/cd3283271c71c1dd75a5f113fc7003eb.poster.avif?t=1788217180\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952510/extras/cd3283271c71c1dd75a5f113fc7003eb.webm?t=1788217180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952510/extras/cd3283271c71c1dd75a5f113fc7003eb.mp4?t=1788217180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952510/extras/d9e0b3ec2b969355e08b7783e52e7c06.avif?t=1788217180\" width=1393 height=147 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952510/extras/122b3be1a9a2490311d570611e011b5e.poster.avif?t=1788217180\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952510/extras/122b3be1a9a2490311d570611e011b5e.webm?t=1788217180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952510/extras/122b3be1a9a2490311d570611e011b5e.mp4?t=1788217180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Set in the colorful world of <strong>Block City</strong>, you'll step into the sneakers of outrageous characters armed to the teeth with zany weapons and unforgettable style. Forget everything you know about volleyball—this game rewrites the rulebook with style and firepower. Want to blast the ball mid-flight? Deflect a spike with a parry? Use Jump pads to dominate the skies? Go for it. In Block City, it’s not just about scoring points, it’s about doing it with flair!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952510/extras/97462b3e682e00ea1ee7c62e9df804b6.avif?t=1788217180\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952510/extras_big/97462b3e682e00ea1ee7c62e9df804b6.webp?t=1788217180 width=1560 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952510/extras/ca83ea1d5797b0be20f29b43df3c6d71.poster.avif?t=1788217180\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952510/extras/ca83ea1d5797b0be20f29b43df3c6d71.webm?t=1788217180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952510/extras/ca83ea1d5797b0be20f29b43df3c6d71.mp4?t=1788217180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Keep the volley alive! The ball has health, so hit it back before it <strong>explodes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952510/extras/59625d298bcf95d1d74af1556b78d6d2.avif?t=1788217180\" width=1091 height=149 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952510/extras/98f8a90f278645c3e77ed5aa1375e46c.poster.avif?t=1788217180\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952510/extras/98f8a90f278645c3e77ed5aa1375e46c.webm?t=1788217180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952510/extras/98f8a90f278645c3e77ed5aa1375e46c.mp4?t=1788217180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from an all-star roster of Volley Gunners! From the ferocious polar bear Bill R. to rebel leader Sky, every Gunner brings a unique weapon and playstyle to the court.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Chaotic 2v2 Multiplayer Action - </strong>Jump into explosive matches with up to 4 players online or locally! Team up with a friend or settle rivalries head-to-head in frantic volleyball battles!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes &amp; Power ups -</strong> Mix things up with a variety of game modes and  items that can completely change the flow of the match. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 Unique Volley Gunners</strong><br>Choose from a colorful cast of ten unforgettable characters, each with their own personality, signature weapon, and distinct playstyle. Whether you prefer overwhelming firepower, precision shots, or tricky mobility, there's a Gunner that fits your style.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Weapon Classes</strong><br>Master an arsenal of unique weapon type! Every weapon changes the rhythm of the match.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six Courts - </strong>Battle across six vibrant courts scattered throughout Block City. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When Volleyball Meets Firepower!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lock and load, it's time to bump, set, and unleash chaos in the most explosive twist on volleyball yet! <strong>Volley Guns</strong> is a chaotic, cartoon-styled multiplayer party game where classic volleyball rules get a full-throttle makeover…by adding <strong>guns!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952510/extras/07d910bed5fb84b323acc99214d83fd6.avif?t=1788217180\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952510/extras_big/07d910bed5fb84b323acc99214d83fd6.webp?t=1788217180 width=1560 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952510/extras/cd3283271c71c1dd75a5f113fc7003eb.poster.avif?t=1788217180\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952510/extras/cd3283271c71c1dd75a5f113fc7003eb.webm?t=1788217180\" type=\"video/webm; codec