</strong>Jump into explosive matches with up to 4 players online or locally! Team up with a friend or settle rivalries head-to-head in frantic volleyball battles!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes &amp; Power ups -</strong> Mix things up with a variety of game modes and  items that can completely change the flow of the match. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 Unique Volley Gunners</strong><br>Choose from a colorful cast of ten unforgettable characters, each with their own personality, signature weapon, and distinct playstyle. Whether you prefer overwhelming firepower, precision shots, or tricky mobility, there's a Gunner that fits your style.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Weapon Classes</strong><br>Master an arsenal of unique weapon type! Every weapon changes the rhythm of the match.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six Courts - </strong>Battle across six vibrant courts scattered throughout Block City. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "Volleyball x Guns! Bump, Set, and Spike your way to the top in bombastic Volley Guns matches with up to 4 players. Use unique weapons, crazy items, and zany characters on the courts in Volley Guns!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952510/4fa22f1b7c3d00d7b4578623603f6df39074063b/header.jpg?t=1788217180", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952510/b8c34f0199a65b709e489c4f4e17b5d0837ab520/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788217180", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952510/b8c34f0199a65b709e489c4f4e17b5d0837ab520/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=178821